# Scratch / temp
TEMP/
*.tmp
*.log

# Onboarding: INSTALL/install.md + setup.md are tracked source - init copies them into
# a target. Ignore only the runtime artifacts (the fetched engine, plus INSTALL.log via
# the *.log rule above). graduate removes INSTALL/.
INSTALL/engine/

# Setup migration archive: keep the empty folder for reference, ignore captured contents.
AIDOCS/*_SETUP_ARCHIVE/*
!AIDOCS/*_SETUP_ARCHIVE/.gitkeep

# Environment docs: keep the folder, ignore contents (may hold secrets - local-only).
AIDOCS/ENV/*
!AIDOCS/ENV/.gitkeep

# Staging files (transient, written by the engine, cleared on commit). Keep the folder.
AIDOCS/tools/staging/*
!AIDOCS/tools/staging/.gitkeep

# Persistent script state (machine-local). Auto-bootstrapped on first run.
AIDOCS/tools/state.json

# WDDOCS always-local (every mode): deploy runbooks (machine paths / secrets) and the
# session handoff (live status). The rest of WDDOCS is privacy-gated (tracked when
# private, in the public block below when public).
/WDDOCS/RELEASES/*
!/WDDOCS/RELEASES/.gitkeep
/WDDOCS/SESSION_HANDOFF*.md

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# Secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Local MCP server config (machine-local paths / IDs / tokens). Never commit.
.mcp.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Build artifacts
dist/
out/
build/

# Privacy gate (public) - BEGIN. Managed by `engine.mjs privacy`. Do not edit between the markers.
# Project memory + auto-memory + WDDOCS docs stay local. Flip to a private repo with
# `node AIDOCS/tools/engine.mjs privacy --set private` (then `git add` what you want tracked).
AIDOCS/*_MEMORY.md
AIDOCS/*_MEMORY_EXTENDED.md
AIDOCS/*_SESSION.md
AIDOCS/*_SESSION_EXTENDED.md
AIDOCS/*_BACKLOG.md
AIDOCS/*_DEV-AUDIT.md
AIDOCS/*_AUTO-PUSH.md
# Pruned LIFO overflow: auto-prune writes <doc>_ARCHIVE.md as the recovery net.
AIDOCS/*_ARCHIVE.md
AIDOCS/automemory/*
!AIDOCS/automemory/.gitkeep
/WDDOCS/ARCHIVE/*
!/WDDOCS/ARCHIVE/.gitkeep
/WDDOCS/DESIGN/*
!/WDDOCS/DESIGN/.gitkeep
/WDDOCS/IDEAS/*
!/WDDOCS/IDEAS/.gitkeep
# Privacy gate - END

# preserved from WAT321 (pre-migration)
# Build / dependencies
*.vsix
# Local-only docs + reference (working state, not committed)
AIDOCS/
WDDOCS/
ARCHIVE/
# Editor / generated preview
README_PREVIEW.html
TEMP/*
!TEMP/.gitkeep
.env.*
# Machine-local MCP + settings (paths / IDs / tokens)
# --- 321_STD additions ---
# AIDOCS/ is fully ignored above - WAT321 keeps its docs AND the 321_STD engine
# local-only, matching the pre-migration convention (only the /321 router under
# .claude/ is tracked). If AIDOCS/ is ever un-ignored to commit the engine, also
# ignore: AIDOCS/tools/staging/*.json (keep SCHEMA.json + *.example.json),
# AIDOCS/tools/staging/.lock, AIDOCS/tools/state.json, AIDOCS/*_SETUP_ARCHIVE/, AIDOCS/ENV/
